<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-RAIN PREVENTS PLAY AT CENTURION PARK.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN PREVENTS PLAY AT CENTURION PARK.</headline>
<dateline>CENTURION 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermittent morning drizzle prevented any play before lunch on the final day of the four-day Supersport Series cricket match at Centurion Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal, in reply to Transvaal's first innings of 201 for six declared, remain on their overnight score of 103 for three.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Transvaal 201-6 declared (Adam Bacher 102).</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal 103-3 in 35 overs (Roy Pienaar 50 not out).</p>
